// Prune off means apply deletes nothing, so a definition it does not own is
// news, not a hazard. Blocking there bought no safety and halted unrelated
// work until a human adopted or deleted it — and it disagreed with the
// unrecorded-baseline case, which already treated the same row as advisory.
