140	  // the `public` role: only the schema OWNER can run DDL there (including
141	  // DROP/CREATE SCHEMA). Embedded Postgres and superuser/owner connections can recreate
142	  // the whole schema; a plain (non-owner) connection user against a real PG15+
143	  // server cannot, and `DROP SCHEMA IF EXISTS public CASCADE` fails with
